e\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><nav class=\"stud-nav\"><a href=\"#waitlist\"><span class=\"stud-logo\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/logo_transparent_bg.png\" alt=\"Stud\" class=\"\"/><span>STUD</span></span></a><div class=\"hero-nav-links\" aria-label=\"Product navigation\"><button type=\"button\">How to</button><button type=\"button\">Start</button><button type=\"button\">Build</button><button type=\"button\">Safety</button><button type=\"button\">Docs</button><button type=\"button\">Tools</button><button type=\"button\">Pricing</button></div><button class=\"nav-button\" type=\"button\">Build a game</button></nav><div class=\"hero-content\"><h1>Stud lets you build an entire Roblox game with agents</h1><p>Run scripting, worldbuilding, UI, DataStores, and live Studio ops.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><button class=\"hero-button is-primary\" type=\"button\">Build a game</button><button class=\"hero-button is-secondary\" type=\"button\">Check out the launch</button></div></div><div class=\"hero-task-stack\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"hero-task-row is-active\"><span></span><small>Task running</small><strong>Generate world</strong></div><div class=\"hero-task-row\"><span></span><small>Task Completed</small><strong>Write Luau scripts</strong></div><div class=\"hero-task-row\"><span></span><small>Task Completed</small><strong>Place assets</strong></div></div><div class=\"hero-file-card\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><small>Studio patch plan</small><strong>CombatController.luau</strong><span>+18 lines · approval ready</span></div><div class=\"hero-resource-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MCP route · Studio live</div></section><div class=\"stud-body\"><section class=\"stud-section stud-features\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><h2 class=\"stud-section-title\">Everything you need,<br/>nothing you don&#x27;t.</h2><p class=\"stud-section-copy\">A complete toolkit for Roblox development. Every feature is free and open source.</p></div><div class=\"stud-container\"><div class=\"feature-frame\"><aside class=\"feature-sidebar\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Features</p><nav><button class=\"feature-tab \" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span>AI Assistant</span></button><button class=\"feature-tab is-active\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-blocks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 22V7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H2\"></path><rect x=\"14\" y=\"2\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg><span>Roblox Studio</span></button><button class=\"feature-tab \" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wrench\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z\"></path></svg><span>Smart Tools</span></button><button class=\"feature-tab \" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><span>Permission System</span></button><button class=\"feature-tab \" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg><span>Open Source</span><small>Community Driven</small></button></nav></aside><div class=\"feature-stage\"><div class=\"soft-backdrop\"></div><div class=\"studio-window\"><header><span class=\"stud-logo\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/logo_transparent_bg.png\" alt=\"Stud\" class=\"\"/><span>STUD</span></span><strong>Studio Tools</strong></header><div class=\"studio-ui panel-swap\"><div class=\"studio-rail\"><span>rules</span><span>village builder</span><b>combat system</b><span>spawn area</span><span>UI refactor</span></div><div class=\"studio-main\"><div class=\"search-pill\">Search or type a command...</div><h4>Add sword combat system</h4><div class=\"prompt-line\">Search the toolbox for &quot;medieval village assets&quot; and insert the best one into Workspace</div><div class=\"tool-result\"><div class=\"tool-head\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><span>Toolbox Search</span></div><div class=\"asset-card\"><img src=\"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-118b27b7f6a9283190692ac5aa42061d/150/150/Model/Png/noFilter\" alt=\"Medieval Village Pack\"/><span>Medieval Village Pack</span><small>Model · BuildCraft</small></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"feature-copy-strip panel-swap\"><h3>Studio Tools</h3><p>Search assets, edit instances, and pipe Roblox Studio work through one focused terminal interface.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"stud-section launch-system-section\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><div class=\"launch-system-heading\"><h2 class=\"stud-section-title\">A calm control room for Roblox agents</h2><p class=\"stud-section-copy\">Stud keeps Studio, MCP tools, approvals, and Roblox context visible as file-like artifacts instead of hiding work inside generic chat cards.</p></div><div class=\"launch-system-grid\"><div class=\"document-stack\" aria-label=\"Stud setup documents\"><article class=\"document-card\"><div class=\"document-card-top\"><span>Required</span><small>Roblox Studio · Session pairing</small></div><h3>Studio Bridge Setup</h3><p>Install the plugin, connect your session code, and keep HTTP access visible before any agent run starts.</p><div class=\"document-lines\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article><article class=\"document-card\"><div class=\"document-card-top\"><span>Context</span><small>Workspace · Scripts · Services</small></div><h3>Place Audit</h3><p>Stud reads the scene tree, open scripts, selected instances, and MCP routes before proposing changes.</p><div class=\"document-lines\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article><article class=\"document-card\"><div class=\"document-card-top\"><span>Safety</span><small>Approvals · Diffs · Rollback</small></div><h3>Permission Log</h3><p>Every risky Studio mutation stays attached to a human decision, with the exact scope preserved.</p><div class=\"document-lines\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article></div><aside class=\"resource-panel\"><div class=\"resource-panel-head\"><span>Launch resources</span><button type=\"button\">Open docs</button></div><div class=\"resource-pill-row\"><button type=\"button\">MCP</button><button type=\"button\">Studio Plugin</button><button type=\"button\">Toolbox</button><button type=\"button\">DataStores</button></div><div class=\"resource-task-list\"><div class=\"resource-task-row\" style=\"--row:0;--row-delay:0ms\"><span></span><small>Task running</small><strong>Map current Workspace</strong></div><div class=\"resource-task-row\" style=\"--row:1;--row-delay:85ms\"><span></span><small>Approval needed</small><strong>Insert toolbox asset</strong></div><div class=\"resource-task-row\" style=\"--row:2;--row-delay:170ms\"><span></span><small>Task completed</small><strong>Patch ServerScriptService</strong></div><div class=\"resource-task-row\" style=\"--row:3;--row-delay:255ms\"><span></span><small>Task queued</small><strong>Generate Studio checklist</strong></div></div><div class=\"resource-actions\"><button type=\"button\">Review safety</button><button class=\"is-primary\" type=\"button\">Join waitlist</button></div></aside></div></div></section><section class=\"stud-container workflow-wrap\"><div class=\"workflow-card\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/redwoods-2.png\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"grid-overlay\"></div><div class=\"project-tree\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Project Tree</p><span>src</span><span>server</span><span>matchmaking.lua</span><span>queue-manager.lua</span><span>client</span><span>hud-controller.lua</span><span>ui-theme.lua</span><span>shared</span></div><div class=\"hidden-run\"><span>&gt;_ hidden-run.stud</span><p>◆ Get Children &quot;game.Workspace&quot;</p><p>◆ Edit Script &quot;ServerScriptService.Main&quot;</p><p>~ Inserting asset from Toolbox...</p></div><div class=\"run-panel panel-swap\"><div class=\"run-meta\"><span>&gt;_ Stud</span><small>4.2k tokens · $0.03</small></div><div class=\"run-row\" style=\"--row:0;--row-delay:0ms\"><span>◆ Get Children &quot;game.Workspace&quot;</span><small>47 instances</small></div><div class=\"run-row\" style=\"--row:1;--row-delay:85ms\"><span>◆ Get Script &quot;ServerScriptService.Main&quot;</span><small>source retrieved</small></div><div class=\"run-row\" style=\"--row:2;--row-delay:170ms\"><span>◆ Edit Script</span><small>+18 -4 lines</small></div><div class=\"run-row\" style=\"--row:3;--row-delay:255ms\"><span>~ Inserting asset...</span></div></div></div><div class=\"integration-band\"><div><p class=\"panel-swap\">AI coding assistant with deep Roblox Studio integration. Edit scripts, manipulate instances, and query DataStores. All from your terminal.</p><div class=\"segmented\"><span>How developers use Stud</span><button class=\"active\" type=\"button\">Roblox</button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\">General</button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\">Scripts</button></div></div><aside><h3>Join the waitlist</h3><p>Get early access to launches, private demos, and new Roblox workflows as they ship.</p><button class=\"btn btn-dark\" type=\"button\">Join Waitlist</button></aside></div></section><section class=\"stud-section tools-section\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><h2 class=\"stud-section-title\">Powerful tools at your fingertips</h2><p class=\"stud-section-copy wide\">Read, write, edit, and search your codebase with natural language. Execute commands and delegate complex tasks to subagents.</p><div class=\"tool-tabs\"><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><circle cx=\"11.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M13.3 16.3 15 18\"></path></svg>Read &amp; Write</button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg>Glob &amp; Grep</button><button class=\"active\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Bash Execution</button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg>Subagent Delegation</button></div><div class=\"command-visual panel-swap\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/cliff.png\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"terminal-card terminal-card-animated\"><header><span class=\"stud-logo\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/logo_transparent_bg.png\" alt=\"Stud\" class=\"\"/><span>STUD</span></span><small>2.1k tokens · $0.02</small></header><p style=\"--row:0;--row-delay:0ms\"><span>$ rojo build -o game.rbxl</span><small>exit 0</small></p><p style=\"--row:1;--row-delay:85ms\"><span>$ selene src/</span><small>0 warnings</small></p><p style=\"--row:2;--row-delay:170ms\"><span>$ npm run build</span><small>exit 0</small></p><p style=\"--row:3;--row-delay:255ms\"><span>~ Running...</span><i></i></p></div></div><div class=\"tool-caption\"><div><h3>Bash Execution</h3><p>Run any shell command with intelligent output handling and permission controls.</p></div><button type=\"button\">Explore all tools <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></section><section class=\"stud-section roblox-section\" id=\"roblox-tools\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><h2 class=\"stud-section-title\">Built for Roblox developers</h2><p class=\"stud-section-copy wide\">27+ specialized tools for Roblox Studio. Edit scripts, manipulate instances, query DataStores, and search the Toolbox.</p><div class=\"roblox-grid\"><div class=\"roblox-list\"><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Script Editing</h3><p>Read, write, and edit Luau scripts directly in Roblox Studio instances.</p></div></button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Instance Manipulation</h3><p>Create, move, delete, and modify any instance in the game hierarchy.</p></div></button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><div><h3>DataStore Access</h3><p>Query and update DataStores for testing and debugging player data.</p></div></button><button class=\"active\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3>Toolbox Search</h3><p>Find and insert models, plugins, and assets from the Roblox Toolbox.</p></div></button><button type=\"button\">Roblox integration guide <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"toolbox-visual\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/redwoods-2.png\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"toolbox-modal panel-swap\"><header><h3>Search Toolbox</h3><span>esc</span></header><div class=\"input\">village|</div><div class=\"toolbox-row selected\"><img src=\"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-118b27b7f6a9283190692ac5aa42061d/150/150/Model/Png/noFilter\" alt=\"\"/><div><b>Medieval Village Pack</b><span>Model · BuildCraft ✓</span></div></div><div class=\"toolbox-row\"><img src=\"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-118b27b7f6a9283190692ac5aa42061d/150/150/Model/Png/noFilter\" alt=\"\"/><div><b>Villager House</b><span>Model · BlockBuilder ✓</span></div></div><div class=\"toolbox-row\"><img src=\"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-118b27b7f6a9283190692ac5aa42061d/150/150/Model/Png/noFilter\" alt=\"\"/><div><b>Village Town Center</b><span>Model · MapMakers ✓</span></div></div><div class=\"toolbox-row\"><img src=\"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-118b27b7f6a9283190692ac5aa42061d/150/150/Model/Png/noFilter\" alt=\"\"/><div><b>Fantasy Village Kit</b><span>Model · RPGAssets</span></div></div><div class=\"toolbox-row\"><img src=\"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-118b27b7f6a9283190692ac5aa42061d/150/150/Model/Png/noFilter\" alt=\"\"/><div><b>Village Market Stall</b><span>Model · DetailProps ✓</span></div></div><footer>↑↓ navigate    ↵ select</footer></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"stud-section capabilities\" id=\"docs\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><p class=\"center-statement\">Stud understands your codebase deeply, learning your patterns to write code that fits naturally into your project.</p><h2 class=\"tech-title\">Powerful capabilities under the hood</h2><p class=\"stud-section-copy wide\">Modern AI with deep tooling integration for a seamless development experience.</p><div class=\"capability-grid\"><article><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></div><span><h3>LSP Integration</h3><p>Full language server support for intelligent code navigation and diagnostics.</p></span></article><article><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plug\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22v-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M17 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"></path><path d=\"M9 8V2\"></path></svg></div><span><h3>MCP Protocol</h3><p>Extensible Model Context Protocol support for custom tool integrations.</p></span></article><article><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-history\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"></path></svg></div><span><h3>Session Management</h3><p>Resume sessions, track token usage, and manage conversation history.</p></span></article><article><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></div><span><h3>Subagent System</h3><p>Delegate complex tasks to background agents that work in parallel.</p></span></article><article><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><circle cx=\"11.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M13.3 16.3 15 18\"></path></svg></div><span><h3>Smart File Handling</h3><p>Glob patterns, regex search, and intelligent file reading with context limits.</p></span></article><article><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div><span><h3>Terminal Native</h3><p>A beautiful TUI that feels at home in your terminal workflow.</p></span></article></div></div></section><section class=\"permission-section\" id=\"permissions\"><div class=\"stud-container narrow\"><h2 class=\"stud-section-title centered\">You&#x27;re always in control</h2><p class=\"stud-section-copy centered-copy\">A robust permission system ensures Stud only takes actions you approve.</p><div class=\"permission-visual\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/redwoods-dark.png\" alt=\"\"/><div class=\"permission-card panel-swap\"><h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->Configurable Policies</h3><p><span>✓ Read files</span><b class=\"allow\">always allow</b></p><p><span>✓ Glob &amp; Grep</span><b class=\"allow\">always allow</b></p><p><span>△ Write files</span><b class=\"ask\">ask each time</b></p><p><span>△ Bash commands</span><b class=\"ask\">ask each time</b></p><p><span>× Destructive ops</span><b class=\"deny\">always deny</b></p></div></div></div><div class=\"stud-container permission-grid\"><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><h3>Granular Permissions</h3><p>Approve individual actions or grant session-wide access per tool type.</p></button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Full Transparency</h3><p>See exactly what Stud will do before any action is taken, including full diffs.</p></button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3>Deny by Default</h3><p>Sensitive operations like file writes and bash commands require explicit approval.</p></button><button class=\"active\" type=\"button\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Configurable Policies</h3><p>Set up permission rules and agent configurations that match your workflow.</p></button></div><button class=\"permission-link\" type=\"button\">Learn about permissions <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></section><section class=\"cta-section\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Waitlist Access</p><h2>Get early access to Stud for Roblox.</h2><p>Join the waitlist to get launch updates, private demos, and first access to new Roblox workflows.</p><div><button class=\"btn btn-metal\" type=\"button\">Join Waitlist</button><button class=\"btn btn-dark\" type=\"button\">Read Docs</button></div></div></section><footer class=\"stud-footer\"><div class=\"stud-container\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><div><span class=\"stud-logo\"><img src=\"/stud/assets/logo_transparent_bg.png\" alt=\"Stud\" class=\"stud-logo-img-lg\"/><span>STUD</span></span><p>Open-source AI coding assistant built for Roblox developers.</p></div><nav><span>Product</span><button type=\"button\">Join Waitlist</button><a href=\"#docs\">Documentation</a><a href=\"#roblox-tools\">Tools</a></nav></div><div class=\"footer-mark\"><a href=\"#waitlist\">STUD</a><p>© 2026 Stud. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></footer></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static